// VeloEdit program icon resource.
//
// Icon id 1 is the executable's default icon: Windows shows it for
// VeloEdit.exe in Explorer, on the taskbar, and in Alt-Tab, and the
// window-class registration in the GUI uses this same id for the
// window's title-bar and taskbar icon. The build script (build.rs)
// compiles this file from inside the assets folder, so the bare
// filename below is correct.
1 ICON "veloedit.ico"
